WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.737
Send to Amazon or STA is the shipment creation workflow for fulfillment by Amazon or FBA.

00:00:07.737 --> 00:00:14.023
This streamlined workflow helps you ship your FBA products to Amazon fulfillment centers.

00:00:14.023 --> 00:00:22.243
To locate the STA page, open the Seller Central main menu, hover over Inventory and click Shipments.

00:00:22.243 --> 00:00:29.980
You'll arrive at the shipping queue page, which provides the list of shipments you're working on,

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:32.578
and those you've already sent to Amazon.

00:00:32.578 --> 00:00:36.660
From here, click Send to Amazon in the top shipments menu.

00:00:36.660 --> 00:00:44.860
Note that the top shipments menu is also available on each FBA page, such as FBA inventory and shipments.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:48.340
The STA workflow has a total of five steps.

00:00:48.340 --> 00:00:51.820
However, the number of steps you need to complete

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:56.565
depends on whether you're shipping boxes or pallets and your choice of carrier.

00:00:56.565 --> 00:00:57.660
You can learn

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:04.180
about each step in the Send to Amazon workflow by searching for Send to Amazon in Seller Central.
